[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12721.91, "timestamp": "03:32:01", "text": "也可以做链接点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12723.67, "timestamp": "03:32:03", "text": "关联"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12726.389, "timestamp": "03:32:06", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12731.11, "timestamp": "03:32:11", "text": "一个点亮的链接。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12733.67, "timestamp": "03:32:13", "text": "例如，我合作的那个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12736.55, "timestamp": "03:32:16", "text": "Sharesa，她有一个链接。你只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12738.63, "timestamp": "03:32:18", "text": "需要这位独立的 YouTuber，社交"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12740.71, "timestamp": "03:32:20", "text": "链接、你的 YouTube 频道、你的个人资料"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12742.63, "timestamp": "03:32:22", "text": "信息，你的内容，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12745.83, "timestamp": "03:32:25", "text": "一切。你的话题标签和你的私信"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12748.55, "timestamp": "03:32:28", "text": "东西，摊位，棉花糖爱好者，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12750.55, "timestamp": "03:32:30", "text": "亚马逊。谢谢。所有那些东西。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12753.19, "timestamp": "03:32:33", "text": "这就足够了。你不需要定制"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12755.91, "timestamp": "03:32:35", "text": "网站，所有那些东西。我只是要走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12759.91, "timestamp": "03:32:39", "text": "因为我的同行，我的YouTube之旅是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12761.83, "timestamp": "03:32:41", "text": "不仅限于虚拟管家。是的，这就是原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12765.11, "timestamp": "03:32:45", "text": "我之所以格外用心，是因为拍摄视频是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12768.63, "timestamp": "03:32:48", "text": "接下来要说的应该不是乔的性格特征，对吧？有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12771.83, "timestamp": "03:32:51", "text": "我打算从事音乐相关的工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12773.83, "timestamp": "03:32:53", "text": "未来。这就是为什么我感觉自己像是在做一件……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12775.349, "timestamp": "03:32:55", "text": "地点"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12776.18, "timestamp": "03:32:56", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https